4 dev Command
*************

‘rl dev’ runs the current project by reading ‘rl.toml’ in the current
directory.

4.1 Options
===========

‘--vm’
     Run through the bytecode VM.

‘--cranelift’
     JIT compile via cranelift.

4.2 Examples
============

     $ rl dev


