8 compile Command
*****************

‘rl compile FILE’ lexes, parses, resolves, and compiles a ‘.rl’ source
file to ‘.rlc’ bytecode.

8.1 Options
===========

‘-o PATH, --output PATH’
     Output ‘.rlc’ path.  Defaults to FILE with its extension changed to
     ‘.rlc’.

8.2 Examples
============

     $ rl compile script.rl
     $ rl compile script.rl -o output.rlc


