16 Examples
***********

16.1 Running a Script
=====================

     $ rl run hello.rl
     Hello, world!

16.2 Running with Arguments
===========================

     $ rl run script.rl -- --verbose input.txt

16.3 Inline Code
================

     $ rl run -c 'println("hello")'
     hello

16.4 Type Checking
==================

     $ rl check script.rl

16.5 Formatting
===============

     $ rl format script.rl

16.6 Compiling to Bytecode
==========================

     $ rl compile script.rl -o output.rlc

16.7 Printing Tokens
====================

     $ rl print script.rl --tokens

16.8 Transpiling to C
=====================

     $ rl transpile script.rl --runtime --compile

16.9 Packaging a Binary
=======================

     $ rl package script.rl -o myapp

16.10 Starting the REPL
=======================

     $ rl repl
     repl> 2 + 2
     4
     repl> exit


